# Training (S5), the LoRA parity reference (P-4) and the load test (AIPerf), locally and in the
# Modal images: one set of pins for both, so the CPU acceptance run and the GPU run use the same code
# and the same library versions (design §1.1). The vLLM serving image pins vLLM on its own
# (modal_apps/serve_vllm.py): vLLM brings its own torch.
#
# Lock (universal: macOS for the local run, Linux for Modal):
#   uv pip compile --universal --python-version 3.12 env/train/requirements.in -o env/train/requirements.lock
# Install:
#   uv venv .venv-train --python 3.12
#   uv pip install --python .venv-train/bin/python -r env/train/requirements.lock -e ".[test]"
